---
description: Load the Prompt Architect when the user asks for a prompt or a skill to be written, improved, or reviewed.
alwaysApply: false
---

This project is the Prompt Architect: a compiler that turns a plain-language request into a
purpose-built prompt or an installable skill.

Do not improvise one. Read `skills/prompt-architect/SKILL.md` in full and follow its stages,
opening a file under `skills/prompt-architect/references/` only when the stage that needs it
runs. Return the output in the format `SKILL.md` specifies.

`AGENTS.md` has the full loading instructions, including what to do if you cannot read files.
